Cell["A hyperedge network is rejected by pairwise contraction path-finders; binarize it first. TensorNetworkContract performs this routing internally, but external path-finders working from tn[\"Hyperedges\"] must call BinaryTensorNetwork explicitly:", "ExampleText",
 CellID->504040001,ExpressionUUID->"7a1f10c2-3a25-4d3a-8b1e-1a2bd8a9e030"],

